0,Music of Tokelau - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Tokelau,"The music of Tokelau occurs in the atolls of Atafu, Nukunonu, and Fakaofo. It is dominated by communal choral activity in harmony, with percussive accompaniment including log drums (pate), pokihi (wooden box) and apa (biscuit tin).",Tokelauan,Austronesian
