5,Music - Tokelau,https://www.tokelau.org.nz/About+Us/Music.html,"The songs, written by Opetaia, are sung in Tokelauan and combine modern melodies with traditional instruments with an emphasis on the traditional Pacific log drum or 'Pate'.",Tokelauan,Austronesian
