7,Tokelauan Robin Hooper LANGUAGES OF THE WORLD/Materials 5,https://theswissbay.ch/pdf/Books/Linguistics/Mega+linguistics+pack/Austronesian/Tokelauan+(Hooper).pdf,"The Tokelauan language belongs to the Austronesian language family, and is placed by current sub-grouping theories in the Samoic-Outlier branch of the Polynesian languages.",Tokelauan,Austronesian
